+SDK stage provenance
+====================
+
+Imported from the bootrom.tar.gz supplied with this migration.
+start.S preserves the .text bytes, defined symbols and text relocations
+of start.o. stages.S preserves the exact move_data.img and boot2.img bytes.
+These imported vendor portions retain their original licensing; this
+migration does not assign a new license to the vendor bytes.
+
+en751627: unopen_img/en7516/start.o
+  SHA256: 35e80d7ff3bbd572a8ceb800c682db6e89d60aece5ea3707d6bf6c610613b361
+en751627: unopen_img/en7516/move_data.img
+  SHA256: ab5b93b0ba3b2fd7887d7c3525c64705d92630fa2cc11e2a55b768545176a857
+en751627: unopen_img/en7516/boot2.img
+  SHA256: deabb0af8021f51d115f95808e6c7b46ae4917bd86fd3e9d53f36b6c23a34c3f
+en7528: unopen_img/en7528/LE/start.o
+  SHA256: 97c23acaacb683a8e3075e214180695985c434dc258659714faebc410bd892b1
+en7528: unopen_img/en7528/LE/move_data.img
+  SHA256: 1f1f06ea666d25382a09225eff3b7bb93753d8b8c6a8aa9109d249bcaeb05a56
+en7528: unopen_img/en7528/LE/boot2.img
+  SHA256: 088e284fc6516ece12cc1e1a3f6f5a89cff732d8bdfbfddccfe7626a3f8a3dd6
+
+The EN751627 DDR LOAD segment remains unmodified on disk. The image
+packer writes a jump to 0x9fa30280 in its otherwise zero initial bytes,
+because SDK boot2 enters calibration at 0x9fa30000.
+EN7528 uses the existing reconstructed calibration sources with an
+explicit SRAM stack and UART initialization.
